<title>USA: Cyprus Amax Minerals Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Cyprus Amax Minerals Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>DENVER, April 24 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.56		    $0.62</p>
<p> Net			 57,000		   62,000</p>
<p> Revs		     888,000		  684,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  93,400		   93,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Cyprus Amax Minerals Co.</p>
<p>Fully diluted earnings per share were less than three percent dilutive.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 results reflect after-tax gain of $29 million, or $0.28 per share, from settlement of certain tax issues and impact of coal contract settlement.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 1997 estimate was $0.22 per share.</p>
</text>
